    "seq": 1,
    "toolResult": "\"**知识库：** question-acceptance-c8494bc8（group_id: `f8b8ddbe-7b0f-4e41-8f4e-48e33dac3ada`，已发布 MDL 版本：2）\\n\\n---\\nnl: 2025年有效订单销售额是多少？\\nsql: SELECT SUM(amount_cents) / 100.0 AS total_sales_amount FROM \\\"order\\\" WHERE order_time >= '2025-01-01 00:00:00'   AND order_time <= '2025-12-31 23:59:59'   AND status IN ('PAID', 'COMPLETED')   AND is_deleted = 0\\nsource: user\\nverified: true\\nvalidation_id: 6336ed2e-0384-431e-abe0-1881985efbca\\nmodel_hash: 094914fc03293bc673b732e757d586bfad7e9274ab67a44ebee14d024b2f5b6a\\nconfirmed_by: bob\\n---\\n\\n# 业务口径\\n\\n统计 2025 自然年（按 order_time）的有效订单销售额。\\n- 时间范围：order_time 落在 2025-01-01 00:00:00 至 2025-12-31 23:59:59 之间。\\n- 有效订单过滤：status 为 PAID 或 COMPLETED，且 is_deleted = 0。\\n- 金额口径：amount_cents 为分，除以 100 得到元；不扣退款。\\n- 统计粒度：全期汇总，无分组。\\n- 单位：元。\\n- 不涉及客户关联。\\n\\n# SQL\\n\\n```sql\\nSELECT SUM(amount_cents) / 100.0 AS total_sales_amount\\nFROM \\\"order\\\"\\nWHERE order_time >= '2025-01-01 00:00:00'\\n  AND order_time <= '2025-12-31 23:59:59'\\n  AND status IN ('PAID', 'COMPLETED')\\n  AND is_deleted = 0\\n```\\n\\n请核对口径并重新查询；不得把示例当作固定答案。\""
